                <pb facs="0499" n="467" xml:id="pg467"/>

                <head>173. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On November 21 the National Security Council issued a revised version of NSC
                    5805/1, “U.S. Policy Toward Yugoslavia.” In a November 23 memorandum
                    accompanying the revised text, James S. Lay, Executive Secretary of the NSC,
                    noted that the NSC Planning Board decided that “only revisions of an editorial
                    nature were necessary to bring this policy up to date.” A copy of the revised
                    version of NSC 5805/1 is in Department of State, S/S–NSC Files: Lot 62 D1, NSC
                    5805. Regarding NSC 5805/1, see <ref target="#d120">Documents 120</ref> and <ref
                        target="#d122">122</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
